  "notes": "Released under the name LLaMA (Large Language Model Meta AI); from the Llama 2 launch on Meta calls it Llama 1 (src.meta.llama-2-announcement, src.meta.llama-2-paper). Weights went only to approved researchers, so openWeights is not recorded. The paper also describes LLaMA-I, a 65B instruction-finetuning experiment that was not released. The paper appeared on arXiv on 2023-02-27, three days after the launch post. The launch post links the model card on the main branch, which now shows the Llama 2 card; the LLaMA card is on the llama_v1 branch."
